Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.44,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's 'cause we're from the same camp, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.07,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Camp...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Like the ones you see in sci-fi shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.75,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We're all guinea pigs used \Nfor Prime Rights research.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:18.25,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Guinea pigs...? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:20.50,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You dunno the half of Prime Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.96,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's an invention of human greed \Non a whole 'nother level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:27.92,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We're nothing but failed mediums \Nhousing that greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:36.41,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:39.08,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:43.75,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.22,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Failures?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:05.46,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Let's just say they used whatever means \Nto force us into gaining Prime Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.77,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Forced...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.23,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:12.70,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi lost hearing in his right ear, \Nand Sensei lost his right eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:13.90,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:18.69,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They sacrificed crucial body parts\N because they were forced to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.69,0:02:21.50,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Anyone with Prime Rights \Nprior to Tasuketsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.85,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,came from this "camp"!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:28.18,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We're failures who couldn't yield \Nthe desired outcome of experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:31.09,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Meaning the Emperor was \Nthe only "success" of the bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:34.61,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Success? Failures? What "camp"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.51,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And why were Omi and the others there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:39.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have a boatload of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.85,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Tell ya what!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:44.77,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,How 'bout I give you some information, \Nand you give me Omi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.48,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,N-No way I could—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.42,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sane, let's take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:54.24,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Omi in exchange for juicy info? Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.32,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What?! Ryuta, are you cra—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.95,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,If it's me you're worried 'bout, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.50,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,...Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.75,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Then it's a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.50,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is there a way to defeat the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Yup! And it's much easier with Omi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:17.55,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But I won't tell you anything beyond that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:21.41,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Why not recruit the owner of the \NObedience Right? Isn't that the strongest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:27.81,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,They're dead. Omi-kun's \Nthe strongest of us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:31.67,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Dead...?! Do you know where the Emperor is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:34.19,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We have plenty of time to look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:37.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Welp! I'm afraid that's all I can share.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Good for you guys Mido \Nwasn't the one to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.33,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is he really that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:45.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We do have different end goals, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:47.58,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,End...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:52.13,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Mido's end goal is to annihilate \Nthe entire human race besides himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:55.88,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,My goal is to annihilate the entire \Nhuman race including myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:59.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,"Zero" and "one"... \NHow close, yet so far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.62,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.11,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Including {\i1}yourself{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:04.85,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Sure! Why be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.02,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:08.57,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Nothing in this world matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:12.11,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Same goes for you guys. \NIf you survive, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:15.53,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You live, reproduce, and die.\N And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.61,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Advancing civilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.53,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Pursuing the arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.16,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Passing down genes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:22.66,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Preserving the species...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:24.91,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:30.03,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,"Love is eternal"? "Make memories"? \N"The soul never dies"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:33.67,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,All this hope around intangible \Nideas that have no guarantee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:37.66,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,What if humans go extinct, the Earth dies, \Nand it gets swallowed by the Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:39.93,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,and the universe comes to an end?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:43.05,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Whether you live or die, none of it matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:44.47,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,He's insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.66,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Some say it's all about \Nliving in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.48,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But that doesn't change the fact \Nthat nothing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.61,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Even murder is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.58,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But look at all these people, mindlessly \Nlooking for the value in futile things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:02.30,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Humans are the worst with \Ntheir misguided intellect,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,which is why I'm gonna kill 'em all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:07.95,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Everything's futile... So \Nhe's fine murdering people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.72,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You guys are gonna kill \Nthe Emperor too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:14.88,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It'd be convenient for me if you get to \Nthem first, so I'll let you live for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.55,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,There, I talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:18.19,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Now gimme Omi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:20.87,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:26.85,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Here's a good hack. All you gotta do in \Nthese situations is agree then ignore 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.06,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Better run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:30.46,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:31.47,Default,Kazuhiko+Gobo+Omi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:34.44,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I got this. You guys go on without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:36.82,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to say that, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:39.74,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Just lemme know how \Nto catch up with you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:43.19,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Okay. We'll take care of Omi, \Nso you better come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.37,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:45.76,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:49.87,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Make sure to tell the teacher \Nif you get a tummy ache!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.50,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You're not my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.81,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You ruined the tension I created!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:02.72,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Never talk about how life \Nis meaningless in front of Sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.23,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.30,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I swear I'll protect those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:07.81,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:11.65,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Promise that you won't chase us, \Ninconvenience us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.48,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,or involve yourself with us \Nat all from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:16.44,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Otherwise I'll kill you right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.40,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I've got a grasp on your Prime Right, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.90,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He instantly split my blade \Nin two, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.21,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The Scission Right under \Nthe Transmutation Attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:25.41,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:29.07,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Let's put it to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:33.54,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.00,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,As long I don't touch him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:38.21,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Cool moves! What sports did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.05,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Spring formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:44.88,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:48.00,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Separate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:49.60,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:56.60,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh, this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.82,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:02.48,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Dammit... How did he {\i0}do{\i1} that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.51,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So it's not the Scission Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:05.74,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Then what is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.97,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,See, get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:12.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Mido wouldn't pair up with just anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:15.42,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Mido's the brains, and I'm the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.62,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So yeah, I guess I'm pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:22.34,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Wanna know my Prime Right before you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:25.67,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Transmutation Attribute. \NPrime Right of Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:26.86,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Division?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:32.12,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Physical division, perceptive division, \Nqualitative division.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:35.31,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I can exercise division \Nwithin these three properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:38.98,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I split your blade with physical division.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:42.52,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I stopped the rubble \Nby dividing the existing space.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:46.40,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,No more space, no more movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:50.07,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,There are some exceptions, \Nbut that's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:52.41,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,How can I beat him...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:56.46,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Now, don't let up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:01.63,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:04.76,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I won't make i—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.01,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:19.56,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Hey, I wondered when I'd see \Nyou again... to avenge Isshiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:24.57,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Hey there... You're that girl \Nwho was with the Isshiki lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:25.99,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,The name's Rika Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.45,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Better remember that, \Nyou decapitating psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:33.30,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Weird... I thought I killed you \Nwhen you came back for Isshiki...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:36.87,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,By crushing you with \Nthe building like I just did now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:40.75,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Sucks for you. You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:44.75,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I can avoid all physical harm \Nwith my Prime Right of Evasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:47.51,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Any cause of harm can be totally evaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:51.01,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Same goes for him as long as he's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:55.26,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Hmm... Then I guess I have \Nno way of killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:58.23,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,W-What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:01.58,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I was at City Hall when a guide popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:03.91,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I followed the screen and here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.91,0:09:04.94,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:08.40,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Presentation Right! Gobo guided her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:11.33,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I had to sacrifice my right leg as a risk...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:14.29,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Can't lie, I resented Isshiki for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.79,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,But I'm alive now thanks to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:20.16,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Moreover... Isshiki was \Na good person at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:22.00,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you for killing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:26.71,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Umm, okay...? Congrats, I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:27.64,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:31.30,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Good for you for surviving! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:35.93,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to you guys \Nkilling the Emperor before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:40.14,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Then maybe you should give us \Nsome more information, Iruga-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.48,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yagi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:44.80,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,He's the one who tossed me over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.40,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Tossed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.09,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Particularly, how to find \Nthe Emperor's whereabouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:52.74,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,how to defeat the Emperor, and \Nstrategies surrounding Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.16,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We could use these three \Npieces of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:57.10,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:59.95,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Bottom line, it's all pretty hit or miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.87,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I think the Emperor's in Tokyo, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:05.75,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,All survivors are within the \N23 wards, so you'd be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:09.46,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You knew and still asked? What a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.26,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Not sure 'bout the right way \Nto beat the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:15.18,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Prolly better to wait for an opening \Nand kill them instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:18.31,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,What else... Oh, right, Tasuketsu strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:21.81,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Let's just say... \NThe key is to block tallies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:27.19,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Tasuketsu can't take place without \Nsubmissions in the Second Stage, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:34.05,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,If you keep a laptop and enter the password \Neach day to avoid recoveries...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:36.07,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,79)}Tasuketsu will not be held today{10:34}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:36.07,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,160)}as questions were not accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:36.07,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,They can't hold Tasuketsu at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:40.33,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Either way, you'll need to get \Nyour hands on a laptop first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.42,Italics,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Why is he so confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.21,Italics,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,...Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:48.72,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,With fewer restraints, there's \Nbound to be more competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:51.86,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Naturally, people will fight \Nthose in possession of a laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:55.68,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You're waiting for the moment they lose \Nownership of their laptop, meaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:59.51,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Mido's Prime Right... it's the \NRight of Succession, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:01.81,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Aw, man! You figured it out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.51,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Right you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:07.91,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We'll get a laptop that way, then keep it \Nwithout submitting any questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.90,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We don't wanna play into \Nthe Emperor's hands, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.65,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:16.66,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Didn't you notice? Anyone can beat Tasuketsu \Nby asking 'who' was 'where' at 'what time'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:21.03,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,What good is Tasuketsu with \Na gaping hole like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:24.85,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Welp, you can figure out \Nthe rest on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:28.96,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'm sure the fight over laptops will \Nbalance out the population, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.54,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you wanna annihilate \Nthe entire human race?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:34.67,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Why go about it in such a roundabout way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:37.41,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You can't underestimate the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:41.39,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Gotta play your hands carefully \Nor it's game over before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:45.10,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'll just say the Rejection Right kid died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.14,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I gave you all the hints you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:49.69,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You'll be able to figure it out \Nif you're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.38,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Maybe ask for some help. Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:56.49,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,from the smartest person you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.99,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:09.79,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,I guess I was right \Nto be cautious, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:13.06,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Why are there people here in Nerima \Nwhen it's not even the Designated Area?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:16.76,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And one of them is Sudo?! \NJust when I lost sight of Souma...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:20.09,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Congratulations, you've both been chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:23.10,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I'm the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.68,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,W-What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.86,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,What a cheap lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:32.11,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Either he's given up by not heading to the \NDesignated Area or he has another motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:36.34,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Based on what he just said, \Nhe's definitely toying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:39.07,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,This guy's a threat... \Na difficult one, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.70,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Get in my way and you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:45.52,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I'll kill you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.48,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:58.09,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm a black belt, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:02.72,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Shinozaki... Sensei, I suppose... \NWhy are you in Nerima?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:07.78,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was chasing Jin yesterday afternoon \Nwhen I was ordered by the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:11.69,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,to disengage and head to \NNerima Ward or be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:14.69,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,An order like that by \Nthe Emperor? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:20.15,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was searching for somewhere safe \Nwhen I found this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:25.53,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,So you ran out of fear and found \Npeace of mind at a school...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.37,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,You're a teacher, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:33.79,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I thought you were vile scum, \Nbut I stand corrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:36.42,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,You're not a bad person, just cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:40.05,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Your misguided choices came \Nfrom a genuine desire to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.55,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Reconsider your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:46.47,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,You may be alive like Narita and the \Nothers, but they have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.39,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.48,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I have my own—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:54.07,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Souma only helps me out of obligation...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.73,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So I'm alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:01.08,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Let me give you a piece of advice \Nin case you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:04.57,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Work together with the others and \Nsurvive as a team until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:08.32,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,And if you still can't find a solution, \Nthen you can betray them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:12.06,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,By that point, they'll be fighting \Namong the group, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:14.08,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,No one would criticize you for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:17.42,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You're telling me to rejoin \NNarita and the others...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:20.38,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yes, if you're not genuinely a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:24.34,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There's no way they'd accept me now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.43,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,A stun grenade...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.02,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Cover your eyes and ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:44.57,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,You seem more intelligent. You die first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:46.84,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:48.66,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:51.41,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll read your every move with my \NVisualization Right and take you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:01.42,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,I'm losing too much blood... \NI don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:04.82,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,He changed his target based on intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:08.05,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Could he have figured out \Nwhy I came to Nerima?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:10.81,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,If so, then he must have the same idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.09,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sudo! You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.09,0:15:14.27,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We've got to stop the bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.22,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Idiot! Don't give him an opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:18.73,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,We have to get to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.32,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But your wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:24.28,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Thankfully... this is my arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:25.86,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,A mic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.07,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Cover your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.41,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Don't take this personally,\N but this is goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.20,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:37.58,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:45.83,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:52.35,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,No matter. He won't make it \Nwith that wound anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.56,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:00.16,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I placed an old radio cassette \Nplayer in a classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:03.56,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Sound from the mic sets off \Nthe meter for detonation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:06.53,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I used fire powder commonly \Ncarried by magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:08.15,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Magicians?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:12.69,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I got it from an old friend \Nwith eccentric hobbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:15.08,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,But never mind that. \NI need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.73,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Go to this school's library.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:21.51,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,You'll find notes I've collected \Non Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:24.62,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,That should tell you... \Nwhere the Emperor is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:27.57,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Get that... to the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.22,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's enough talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.80,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We've got to treat you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.51,Italics,Sudo's Mom,0,0,0,,Ryohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.52,Italics,Sudo's Mom,0,0,0,,Ryohei, look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:42.82,Flashback,Female Voice,0,0,0,,Did you hear about Sudo-san's accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.41,Flashback,Male Voice,0,0,0,,Yeah, the older child was with him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:47.44,Flashback,Female Voice,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.73,Flashback,Sudo's Mom,0,0,0,,That's the same sky your father and Kohei saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.40,Flashback,Sudo's Mom,0,0,0,,There will always be a sky above you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.40,0:16:59.91,Flashback,Sudo's Mom,0,0,0,,As long as it's there, \Nwe'll be connected forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:05.96,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,That day, the sky was so blue and bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:10.14,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,It pierced my heart and \Nfilled it with color and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:16.04,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I wanted to help Mom live comfortably \Non behalf of my dad and brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.80,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,So I did everything I could to get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.60,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H6463CB&\3c&HF5F8ED&\frz8.049\pos(218,157)}Sugishin Prep School {17:21}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:23.34,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,And I joined a prep school \Nwe couldn't afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.82,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,That was where I met...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.53,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(180,38)}May 4   Mock Exam Results {17:27; top row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.53,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(125,125)}First Place   Tojuro Yagihashi   500 points {17:27; second row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.53,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(125,187)}Second Place    Ryohei Sudo    495 points {17:27; third row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.53,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(125,243)}Third Place    Amelia Yamada    456 points {17:27; fourth row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.53,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(125,310)}Fourth Place    Toru Sasaoka    402 points {17:27; fifth row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.33,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(165,38)}May 21    Mock Exam Results {17:43; top row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.33,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(125,125)}First Place   Tojuro Yagihashi   500 points {17:43; second row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.33,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(125,187)}Second Place    Ryohei Sudo    497 points {17:43; third row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.33,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(125,243)}Third Place    Amelia Yamada    451 points {17:43; fourth row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.33,Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H323636&\pos(125,310)}Fourth Place    Yudai Abe    392 points {17:43; fifth row}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.07,0:17:49.36,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Yagihashi! Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.34,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:54.97,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Tuition fees! I heard you paid mine off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:58.14,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Do you feel sorry for me? Am I supposed \Nto be grateful for your help?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.62,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,A fortune teller told me the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:05.25,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Unless I pay your tuition fees, \Nmy parents will explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.52,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Stop making fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:10.78,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I should say the same. \NWho's smarter here―you or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.03,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Do you really think your answer \Nwould be better than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.86,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I figured out. \NThey {\i1}would{\i0} explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:20.00,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I arrived at that conclusion with \Nthis intelligent brain of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:21.41,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It's gotta be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.42,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Green onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:31.42,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Yagihashi...! Poking fun at me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:43.73,Flashback,Sudo's Mom,0,0,0,,Ryohei, that's enough. \NYou need to quit studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.65,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Mom, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:53.53,Flashback_Italics,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,When was the last time I talked \Nwith Mom face to face like this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:59.12,Flashback_Italics,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,It's all my fault. It was supposed to be \Nall for her, but instead I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.75,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Yagihashi? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:05.21,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Did the green onion work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:06.71,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Huh? Green onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:12.78,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Of course. So you knew \Nthis would happen all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:14.30,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,You really got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:16.44,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Green onions are good for colds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:19.01,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You have to keep it on you \Nfor it to work, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:21.30,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,You sure have an odd way of lending a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:23.73,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Were the tuition fees just \Na way to talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:29.07,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,That's only half the reason. \NI happen to admire your work ethic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:34.24,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,As your rival and admirer, I want \Nto see you perform your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:38.59,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,My family and I are actually \Nmoving to Saitama soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:44.32,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,So I want to propose a friendly competition. \NOne that involves our grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:49.16,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Whoever ranks higher in the nationwide \Nmock exam when we enter high school wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:54.54,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,So the tuition was my entry fee...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:55.84,Flashback,Younger Sudo,0,0,0,,Fine, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:57.84,Flashback,Younger Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It's a deal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:22.28,Flashback_Italics,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You really were the one in first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:25.25,Flashback_Italics,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,No wonder I always came in second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:29.21,Flashback_Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yagihashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:33.96,Flashback_Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,You gave me the strength \Nto be my best for Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:37.97,Flashback_Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,I'll make her happy... for my dad \Nand brother's sake. No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:39.80,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7}Two left {top right text on screen; 20:38}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:39.80,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,You are currently looking at this screen {center Japanese text; 20:38}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:50.39,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Congratulations. \NYou are all alive by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:52.94,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:05.07,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,I wonder why?\N Here I am, defeated midway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:07.87,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yet my heart feels like \Nit's been filled with light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:13.68,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right... The sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.56,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's the same sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:20.01,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,1)}Nearby {21:17}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.22,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,from that day.
